{{!
    @template mod_adaptivequiz/attempt_review_actions

    The way out of the attempt review page (issue #22): back to the person's attempts (primary) and, unless the
    page is in a popup or a secure window, to the course (secondary).

    Context variables required for this template:
    * backurl - The person's attempts in this activity.
    * backlabel - Text of the back link.
    * courseurl - The course, or empty.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "backurl": "https://example.org/mod/adaptivequiz/viewattemptreport.php?userid=3&cmid=7",
        "backlabel": "Back to Peter The Student's attempts",
        "courseurl": "https://example.org/course/view.php?id=2"
    }
}}
<nav class="mod_adaptivequiz-review-actions d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center my-3" aria-label="{{#str}}reviewactions, adaptivequiz{{/str}}">
    <a class="btn btn-primary mr-2 mb-2" href="{{backurl}}">{{backlabel}}</a>
    {{#courseurl}}
    <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary mr-2 mb-2" href="{{courseurl}}">{{#str}}reviewtocourse, adaptivequiz{{/str}}</a>
    {{/courseurl}}
</nav>
